  "description": "A girl who can see ghosts. “Baekjeok,” a ghost who has followed her from the past, speaks of love, yet his gaze is fixed on someone else.\n\nAs I become the prey of love, I gradually lose myself.\n\nA romantic thriller where the boundaries of self are distorted, caught between affection and obsession.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
